  "_note": "Map Travel phase 1 (docs/TRAVEL.md): server-priced bus and taxi rides between CT Island venues, plus the free walk. The client never sends a price, origin or distance: the server measures from the player's last accepted island position (ctl:pos) to the destination door in contract/ids/districts.json. Fares are integer Cash cents and flat per mode (wealth unlocks modes via unlockNetWorthCents, it never raises prices). Every value here is a tunable default pending product sign-off. busStops are generated by the frontend repo's tools/world/islandgen/export_bus_stops.py from the island plan (island metres, yaw in degrees clockwise from north, open side towards the road; shelter 'baked' = built by islandgen, 'kit' = placed by the client).",
